      "kind": "text",
      "text": "I am a Visual and Interaction Designer with a successful history of turning ideas into captivating digital experiences in blockchain, fintech, retail, education, and entertainment industries. My expertise lies in engineering user-centered solutions for smart display systems, TV, web, and mobile platforms.",
